## Method

- 0-D and 1-D energy balance models: search for equilibria, stability analysis, and bifurcation diagram.
- Non-linear PDE resolution method from a research paper (Hidalgo & Tello, 2020): finite volumes, WENO reconstruction, Runge-Kutta TVD scheme.

## Results

The model exhibits multiple equilibria, including the "Snowball Earth" state, where the Earth is entirely covered in ice.

